  "description": "gridMET / METDATA is a 4-km daily surface meteorological dataset covering the contiguous US from 1979 onward, produced by blending PRISM monthly normals with NLDAS-2 sub-daily reanalysis. This entry exposes the daily maximum 2-m air temperature variable (tmmx). Native units are Kelvin; values loaded here have already been converted to Celsius upstream in the Amadeus extractor (UCUM 'Cel').",
